veillance/descriptive\", \"ev\": [{\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"COVID-NET conducts population-based surveillance for laboratory-confirmed COVID-19–associated hospitalizations in 99 counties across 14 states.\"}]}, {\"v\": \"before/after or trend\", \"ev\": [{\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"This analysis describes weekly hospitalization rates during Delta- and Omicron-predominant periods.\"}]}], \"methods_quotes\": [{\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Age-adjusted rates were calculated by dividing the number of hospitalized COVID-19 patients by population estimates for race/ethnicity, and vaccination status in the catchment area.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"dividing by the sum of adults with booster or additional doses in the underlying population for each day of the month.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Variances were estimated using Taylor series linearization method.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Chi-square tests were used to compare differences between the Delta- and Omicron-predominant periods; p-values <0.05 were considered statistically significant.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Percentages presented were weighted to account for the probability of selection for sampled cases\"}, {\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"Percentages presented for the overall number are weighted row percentages.\"}], \"confidence\": \"high\", \"uncertain_fields\": []}", "type": "text"}]}